  "goodToKnow": "Das Insekt is an insect. A 2017 study in the German region of Krefeld found that flying insects had declined by more than 75 percent in 27 years, and das Insektensterben became a major environmental topic. Bavaria's 2019 Rettet die Bienen referendum was one of the most successful ever. Der Insektenstich is an insect bite. Colloquially, small bugs are Krabbeltiere or, as pests, Ungeziefer."
